  "_about": "Per-country config for 13 Middle East Arab markets. Strings: one MSA master ('ar') + dialect overlays for overlay_types only. Formatting: pin ICU/CLDR 48 and override only what is listed here. Sources: see reports/Arabic game localization by country.md. 'verify' = flagged as uncertain in research.",
